===Etymology 1===
* An archaic active present participle form of the verb {{m|fi|syödä}} (''*syö-'' + ''-pä''), meaning "one who eats", so called because the disease was once believed to be caused by a worm that eats the body from inside; thus the archaic terms {{m|fi|ruumiinmato}} (lit. "worm of the body") and {{m|fi|koi||moth}}. See also the usage notes for ''[[-pä#Etymology_2|-pä]]''.

